{
  "_readme": "The world is generated from a seed (js/map/worldGen.js) in the style of Sếp's drawing, and painted by js/map/worldPainter.js. What you can change here: how big the world is, how many villages it has, what the player's home starts with, and what each kind of ground holds. NOTE: the grid is three times finer than it used to be — 216x144 hexes of 9.33px instead of 72x48 of 28px — so the island is the same size of paper with nine times as many hexes on it. Every terrain therefore holds about a ninth of what it used to, and one expedition claims a whole district of hexes rather than a single one (js/territory.js).",

